<p align="center" class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:center"><font
size="6"><strong>第９回（’００） 於    
木曽御岳カントリークラブ<br>    
２日目（本戦ラウンド）</strong></font></p>    
    
<hr>    
<div align="center"><center>    
    
<table border="0" cellpadding="0"    
style="mso-cellspacing:1.5pt;mso-padding-alt:    
 0mm 0mm 0mm 0mm">    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030020.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030020_t.jpg" alt="P9030020.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1181"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030002.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030002_t.jpg" alt="P9030002.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1179"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030011.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030011_t.jpg" alt="P9030011.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1037"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">スタート前に記念撮影！</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">陰の画像しかなく、ゴメン深い<br>    
        意味はないからね（笑）</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">仁王立ちで頼もしいね</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030012.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030012_t.jpg" alt="P9030012.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1458"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030013.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030013_t.jpg" alt="P9030013.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1459"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030014.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030014_t.jpg" alt="P9030014.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1460"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ポーズ決まってるね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">いつも遠くからの参加<br>    
        ありがとう</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">笑顔に隠された自信が<br>    
        感じられるね</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030015.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030015_t.jpg" alt="P9030015.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1461"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030016.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030016_t.jpg" alt="P9030016.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1462"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030017.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030017_t.jpg" alt="P9030017.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1463"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">いつも自然体が学生の時から<br>    
        変らないね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ちょっと謙虚に見える<br>    
        のは気のせい？（笑）</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">今年も優勝候補の筆頭です。<br>    
        結果は？</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030018.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030018_t.jpg" alt="P9030018.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1464"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030019.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030019_t.jpg" alt="P9030019.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1465"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"> </td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">指３本は大胆にもＶ３を<br>    
        目指しているのでしょうか？</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">「調子はグー」って<br>    
        感じでしょうね</td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030021.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030021_t.jpg" alt="P9030021.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1762"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030022.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030022_t.jpg" alt="P9030022.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1763"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030023.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030023_t.jpg" alt="P9030023.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1764"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">いつもながらの<br>    
        グッ、ショッ！</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">力強い振り抜きは学生の<br>    
        頃と変りません</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">練習を積んできた<br>    
        きれいなスイング</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030024.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030024_t.jpg" alt="P9030024.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1765"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030025.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030025_t.jpg" alt="P9030025.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1766"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030026.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030026_t.jpg" alt="P9030026.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1767"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">結構飛ぶんだよね<br>    
        ナイスショット！</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ひっぱり気味かな？<br>    
        まあまあだね（笑）</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">フェアウェーキープが<br>    
        上手く、安定感Ｎｏ．１</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030027.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030027_t.jpg" alt="P9030027.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1768"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030028.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030028_t.jpg" alt="P9030028.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1769"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030029.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030029_t.jpg" alt="P9030029.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1770"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ちょっと肘が…<br>    
        枯れたショットだね（笑）</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">きれいなトップ位置だね<br>    
        ここからバシッとね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">クラブが立っててカッコいい！<br>    
        タメが出来てるね</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030030.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030030_t.jpg" alt="P9030030.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1771"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">いいショットになりそう…<br>    
        きっとナイスショットだね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" colspan="3"    
        style="border:solid windowtext .5pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><p    
        align="center" class="MsoNormal"    
        style="text-align:center">表彰式</p>    
        </td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030036.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030036_t.jpg" alt="P9030036.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2052"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030037.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030037_t.jpg" alt="P9030037.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2111"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030038.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030038_t.jpg" alt="P9030038.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2112"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">優勝おめでとう！<br>    
        やはり本命だったね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">準優勝おめでとう<br>    
        優勝まであと一歩</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">第３位おめでとう<br>    
        大きな景品どうするの（笑）</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030034.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030034_t.jpg" alt="P9030034.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2109"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030039.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030039_t.jpg" alt="P9030039.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2220"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030042.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030042_t.jpg" alt="P9030042.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2222"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">第４位<br>    
        同スコアだったけど残念</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">第５位<br>    
        後半は頑張ったよね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">第６位<br>    
        ボールだけで残念そう</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030043.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030043_t.jpg" alt="P9030043.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2224"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030044.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030044_t.jpg" alt="P9030044.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2333"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030046.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030046_t.jpg" alt="P9030046.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2448"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">第７位<br>    
        前半が足を引っ張ったね</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">第８位<br>    
        昨日は良かったけど…</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ＢＭ<br>    
        心境を表して微妙な笑顔</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030045.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030045_t.jpg" alt="P9030045.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2446"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030041.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030041_t.jpg" alt="P9030041.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2335"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030040.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030040_t.jpg" alt="P9030040.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2450"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ＢＢ<br>    
        やってしまいましたＶ３</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ニアピン×２、ドラコン×１<br>    
        たくさん貰って嬉しそう</td>    
        <td valign="top" style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">ドラコン<br>    
        パワーは健在だね</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030047.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030047_t.jpg" alt="P9030047.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2557"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">　</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" colspan="3"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">【優勝の弁】<br>    
        「ハンディキャップのお陰で優勝することができました」と謙虚なお言葉です。<br>    
        グロスで負けてしまった男性陣もいますから、実力の優勝ですよね。<br>    
        ホント、立派でした。優勝おめでとうございます！</td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030048.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030048_t.jpg" alt="P9030048.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i1789"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030049.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030049_t.jpg" alt="P9030049.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2784"></a></td>    
        <td valign="bottom"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt"><a    
        href="P9030050.jpg" target="ImageWindow"><img    
        src="P9030050_t.jpg" alt="P9030050.jpg" border="0"    
        width="200" height="200" id="_x0000_i2786"></a></td>    
    </tr>    
    <tr>    
        <td valign="top" colspan="3"    
        style="padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt">【記念撮影】<br>    
        今年も無事、コンペ終了。初の女性優勝という事で、来年に向け、皆さん練習に<br>    
        力が入るのではないでしょうか？また来年会えるのを楽しみに一年を過ごします！</td>    
    </tr>    
</table>    
</center></div>    
    
